+ * (t20 = the draw's block, t21 = the decode table). Other draws keep the CPU fetch; [vtx-gpu] gives both counts
+ * and the reasons per frame (mean over the last 60 frames). LD_VTX_GPU_MB caps one draw's block (default 8 MB).
+ * -----------------------------------------------------------------------*/
